<title>EGYPT: Paints firm PACHIN end-Q3 results.</title>
<headline>Paints firm PACHIN end-Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first nine months of the financial year 1996/7, which started on July 1:</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, comparative figures in brackets):</p>
<p>Net sales			    194,831,000    (206,276,000)</p>
<p>Production costs		   119,203,000    (118,019,000)</p>
<p>Overheads				2,299,000	(1,912,000)</p>
<p>Exceptional revenue		 17,246,000     (24,484,000)</p>
<p>Exceptional expenses		   530,000	  (391,000)</p>
<p>Net profit before tax	     90,045,000    (110,438,000)</p>
<p>(Full company name is PACHIN/Paints and Chemical Industries)</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
